:: Attend Drama Finish [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += $Time.until(10, 50)>>

/* LATE */
<<if $Late == 1>>
	You arrive at class late and suffer because of it! You have also been given detention!<br>
    <<set $Detention += 5>>
    <<set $Late to 0>>
<</if>>

<<set $DramaClass to 1>>
<<skillPoints "Acting" 10>>

<br>
[[Continue|School Auditorium]]
